/*
  ChartTimeRangeContext.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 shared surface · 0069 · ChartTimeRangeContext (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. The web source
  (components/charts/ChartTimeRangeContext.tsx + components/charts/cursorSync.ts) is an anonymous,
  transparent coordination primitive — it carries no user-facing copy of its own (it only broadcasts
  a syncId/syncMethod and stores the persistent cursor x value), so there are no verbatim web string
  keys to mirror. The only entries here back the DEBUG-only sample charts used by the previews +
  the view-composition tests; they are never shipped. Production callers wrap their own
  already-localized charts.

  These entries fold into the app `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they
  are kept in a per-surface table ("ChartTimeRangeContext") so each parallel surface prompt owns its
  own strings.
*/

